<title>ITALY: HORSE RACING-GRAN PREMIO DI MILANO RESULT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-GRAN PREMIO DI MILANO RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Gran Premio di</p>
<p>Milano, a group one race for three-year-old colts and fillies</p>
<p>and upwards, run over one mile and four furlongs (2.4 km) at San</p>
<p>Siro on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Shantou (ridden by Frankie Dettori)</p>
<p>2. Luso (Gary Stevens)</p>
<p>3. Taipan (Pat Eddery)</p>
<p>Four ran</p>
<p>Distances: One and a quarter lengths, half a length.</p>
<p>Winner owned by Sheikh Mohammed, trained by John Gosden in</p>
<p>England.</p>
<p>Value to the winner: $422,489 dollars.</p>
<p>Tote (includes a ten lira stake): Win 15; places 12, 18.</p>
<p>Dual Forecast 26.</p>
</text>
